<title>UK: Telkom at $30.75 in London.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $30.75 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $30.75 in London on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $30.75 and the day's high of $31.12.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday as $30.8500.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
